.TH NEOWALL.VIBE 5 "2026-10-28" "neowall @VERSION@" "File Formats"
.SH NAME
neowall.vibe \- neowall configuration
.SH SYNOPSIS
.I $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/neowall/config.vibe
.SH DESCRIPTION
The config is written in VIBE: nested blocks of
.I key value
lines,
.B #
comments, and four value types (integer, float, boolean, string).
Quote a string only if it has spaces.
.PP
A
.B default
block applies to every monitor.
An
.B output
block holds one block per connector name (as shown by
.BR "neowall current" );
each overrides
.B default
for that monitor.
.PP
.RS
.nf
default {
  shader garden.glsl
}

output {
  DP\-1     { shader moon_ocean.glsl }
  HDMI\-A\-1 { path ~/Pictures/ duration 600 }
}
.fi
.RE
.PP
A block shows exactly one of
.BR path ,
.B shader
or
.BR terminal .
.PP
.B neowall reload
re\-reads the file.
An invalid file is rejected as a whole and the running config stays.
.SH WHAT TO SHOW
.TP
.BI path " file|dir/"
An image (PNG or JPEG), or a directory of them to cycle through.
.TP
.BI shader " file|dir/"
A GLSL shader.
A bare name is looked up in
.I ~/.config/neowall/shaders/
and then the installed shaders.
A directory cycles through its shaders.
.TP
.BI terminal " command"
Run
.I command
under a pseudo\-terminal and draw it as the wallpaper.
It's restarted if it exits.
.SH CYCLING AND TRANSITIONS
.TP
.BI duration " seconds"
Time between wallpapers in a directory cycle.
.B 0
(default) doesn't cycle.
.TP
.BR shuffle " true|false"
Random order, reshuffled every pass.
.TP
.BR transition " fade|slide_left|slide_right|glitch|pixelate|none"
Effect between images.
.TP
.BI transition_duration " seconds"
Default 0.3.
.TP
.BR mode " fill|fit|center|stretch|tile"
How an image covers the screen.
Default
.BR fill .
.TP
.BI span " bool" "\fR, \fPspan_group" " name"
Stretch one wallpaper across several monitors.
.SH SHADERS
.TP
.BI shader_speed " float"
Animation speed; 1.0 is normal.
.TP
.BR vsync " true|false"
Present on the display's refresh (default).
With
.BR false ,
frames are paced by
.BR shader_fps .
.TP
.BI shader_fps " n"
Target frame rate when vsync is off.
Default 60.
.TP
.BI channels " [a b ...]"
Up to four
.B iChannel
textures, in order, as an array: image paths or the built\-ins
.BR rgba_noise ", " gray_noise ", " blue_noise ", " wood ", " abstract ", " font .
Audio and other live inputs are bound in a shader's
.B .neowall
sidecar instead.
.TP
.BR show_fps " true|false"
Draw a frame\-rate counter.
.TP
.BR pause_on_fullscreen " true|false"
Stop rendering while a window covers the monitor.
.TP
.BI pause_coverage_threshold " 0..1"
How much of the screen must be covered to count.
.SH TERMINAL
.TP
.BI term_cols " n" "\fR, \fPterm_rows" " n"
Grid size in cells.
.B 0
(default) fits the screen.
.TP
.BI term_font_size " px"
Cell font size.
.TP
.BI term_font " file" "\fR, \fPterm_font_bold" " file" "\fR, \fPterm_font_italic" " file"
Fonts.
Unset picks a monospace face through fontconfig.
.TP
.BI term_fg " #rrggbb" "\fR, \fPterm_bg" " #rrggbb"
Default colours.
.TP
.BI term_cwd " dir" "\fR, \fPterm_env" " TERM"
Working directory and
.B $TERM
for the program.
.TP
.BI term_shader " file"
A shader that post\-processes the terminal image.
.TP
.BR term_fade ", " term_bloom ", " term_scanline ", " term_crt ", " term_chroma " \fI0..1\fR"
Built\-in effect strengths.
.SH TOP\-LEVEL KEYS
These go outside any block.
.TP
.BR mouse_interaction " true|false"
Let shaders see the pointer.
Default
.BR true .
.TP
.BR term_raw_input " true|false"
Pass Ctrl\-C and friends to a focused terminal wallpaper.
Default
.BR false .
.SH FILES
.TP
.I @DATADIR@/neowall.vibe
A fully commented example of every option.
.TP
.I @DOCDIR@/CONFIG.md
The long\-form reference.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR neowall (1)
